expedition-extraction-beacon = Evacuation: the expedition closes in {$minutes} min. A beacon is set near the complex, coordinates: X {$x}, Y {$y}. Hook onto the beacon with a grappling gun (some lie next to it): hooked people will be taken by the ship. Everyone else stays on the planet.
expedition-extraction-arriving = An evacuation ship is flying to the beacon. Stay {$meters} m away from the beacon, the landing zone is nearby.
expedition-extraction-arrived = The evacuation ship has arrived and taken the beacon. Stay hooked on it, departure in one minute.
expedition-extraction-departing = The evacuation ship is leaving. People hooked on: {$count}.
